    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "JALERTE\nJAL INTERNATIONAL FLIGHT SCHEDULE\nJAL E*M / JALWAYS JALDI1Z\nJAIL\n2008 9.1 - 10.25\nJolL\nInternational reservation\nDomestic reservation\n0120-25-5931\n0120-25-5971\nwww.jal.co.jp\noneworld\nmember",
      "JI)L\nJAL BAN\nJALWAYS JALDI1Z\nInternational Passenger Timetable:\nAdditional Information [Sep.1~0ct.25 Edition]\nP71•72-L\nP71 • 72 In-flight Services\nJAL To Introduce State-of-the Art\nFirst Class Suite \u0026 Business Class Seat\nIntroduction of 777-300ER on US Routes Fitted with Best Seating and Service in the skies.\nBrand new 777-300ER aircraft will start operating Tokyo-New York route\nfrom August, Tokyo-San Francisco route from September.\nThe route information for new 777-300ER aircraft.\n• New York=Tokyo JL005/JL006\nstarting Aug.1, 2008\nService is available every other day until Aug. 10,\nand will be available daily from Aug.11.\nSan Francisco=Tokyo JL001/JL002\nstarting Sep. 13, 2008\nAvailable daily.\n(Notice) Operating aircraft and seating configurations are subject\nto change without prior notice."
    ],
